    "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0018_d5256b290714.png\" style=\"width:2.48068in;height:0.472in\" /><br />Case <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2,4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> in this case<br />Case <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>x</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>x</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn></math> in this case<br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> The roots are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m of roots</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
